# Copy to .env and fill in.
#
# IMPORTANT: everything here is VITE_-prefixed, which means Vite inlines
# it into the client bundle at BUILD time. On Render these must be set
# BEFORE the build runs, not just before the app starts. Changing one
# without triggering a rebuild does nothing.

# MapTiler API key (free tier at cloud.maptiler.com). Powers the vector
# basemaps, 3D terrain and building extrusions.
#
# The browser talks to api.maptiler.com directly, so this key is public
# by design — that is how MapTiler intend web keys to work. Lock it down
# in their dashboard instead of trying to hide it:
#   Account -> API Keys -> Edit -> restrict to your allowed origins
#   (https://lobster-maps.onrender.com and http://localhost:5173)
#
# Without a key the app falls back to proxied OpenStreetMap raster
# tiles: a map still renders, but flat — no 3D terrain, no building
# extrusions, no basemap switcher.
VITE_MAPTILER_KEY=your-maptiler-api-key

# Optional. OpenRouteService API key (openrouteservice.org, needs
# signup) — real distance/time estimates for directions from the
# business detail sheet. Without it the Directions link falls back to
# opening Google Maps; no broken feature either way.
VITE_ORS_KEY=

# Optional. Mapillary access token (mapillary.com/dashboard/developers,
# needs signup) — powers the Street View toggle: crowdsourced
# street-level photos. Coverage is spottier than Google's actual Street
# View, that is the honest tradeoff of not using Google. Without this
# the toggle button just does not render.
VITE_MAPILLARY_TOKEN=
